OL,3,CTributes paid to family, including
OL,4,Cbaby girl, killed in A38 crash
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to four
OL,7,Fmembers of a family, including an 11-
OL,8,Fmonth-old girl, who died in a
OL,9,F"heartbreaking" crash.
OL,11,FA red Hyundai with five passengers
OL,12,Fleft the A38 and crashed into trees
OL,13,Fclose to the Toyota Island in Derby at
OL,14,Fabout 11pm on Saturday, Derbyshire
OL,15,FPolice said.
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@OO]
