FL,350,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1785338294
OL,3,CTributes paid to family, including
OL,4,Cbaby girl, killed in A38 crash
OL,6,FThe force said the Gambian nationals
OL,7,Fwho lived in Leeds; Abubacarr Camara,
OL,8,F36, and his wife Isa Jaiteh, 30, were
OL,9,Fpronounced dead at the scene while
OL,10,Ftheir baby Aisha Camara was taken to
OL,11,Fhospital and died a short time later.
OL,13,FAn 18-year-old woman, who has not been
OL,14,Fnamed, also died at the scene of the
OL,15,Fcollision, police said.
OL,17,FThe driver, a 33-year-old man who is
OL,18,Fin hospital being treated for serious
OL,19,Finjuries, was arrested on suspicion of
OL,20,Fcausing death by dangerous driving and
OL,21,Fhas now been bailed, the force said.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
