OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,350,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1785338294
OL,3,CTributes paid to family, including
OL,4,Cbaby girl, killed in A38 crash
OL,6,FThe Gambia Welfare Society in Leeds
OL,7,Fdescribed Mr Camara as a "dedicated
OL,8,Fservant of his community" who mentored
OL,9,Fyoung children through football.
OL,11,FThe statement added: "He will be
OL,12,Fremembered for his kindness, humility,
OL,13,Fand selfless service."
OL,15,FThe society said it is "grateful" that
OL,16,Fthe driver survived the collision, and
OL,17,Fits members pray for his "full and
OL,18,Fspeedy recovery".
OL,26,@oD@ZOUpD@YO]sD@VOUuD@VO]wD@XOUwD@aO]yD@
OL,26,AZOUzD@PO]
