CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1785338294
OL,3,CTributes paid to family, including
OL,4,Cbaby girl, killed in A38 crash
OL,6,FOn Monday, the Gambia High Commission
OL,7,Fin the UK described the deaths of the
OL,8,Ffour people, who it said were
OL,9,Ftravelling together from Birmingham to
OL,10,FLeeds, as "tragic".
OL,12,FThe statement added: "Her excellency
OL,13,FDr Fatou Bensouda, High Commissioner
OL,14,Fof the Republic of The Gambia to the
OL,15,FUnited Kingdom, together with the
OL,16,Fstaff of the high commission, extends
OL,17,Fits deepest condolences and heartfelt
OL,18,Fsympathies to the bereaved families
OL,19,Fduring this difficult time.
OL,26,@rD@KOUrD@RO]tD@VOU
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,350,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1785338294
OL,3,CTributes paid to family, including
OL,4,Cbaby girl, killed in A38 crash
OL,6,F"The deputy head of mission, Mr Suntou
OL,7,FTouray, has spoken with the president
OL,8,Fof the Gambia Welfare Society in
OL,9,FLeeds, Mr Yanks Sawo, to convey the
OL,10,Fhigh commission's condolences and to
OL,11,Fco-ordinate with the family's liaison
OL,12,Frepresentative.
OL,14,F"The high commission remains in
OL,15,Fcontact with the relevant authorities
OL,16,Fand the affected families and will
OL,17,Fprovide further updates as more
OL,18,Finformation becomes available.
OL,20,F"May the souls of the departed rest in
OL,21,Fperfect peace."
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOU|D@AOU}D@OO]
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/6
