OL,3,CTributes paid to family, including
OL,4,Cbaby girl, killed in A38 crash
OL,6,FPolice said in a statement: "The
OL,7,Frelatives of those involved have been
OL,8,Fnotified and are being supported by
OL,9,Fspecialist officers.
OL,11,F"Our thoughts are with them at this
OL,12,Fmost distressing time."
OL,26,@nD@]OUsD@AOUtD@WO]
